    "detailed_description": "You like chess and strategy games? You love making up your own tactics? Sukakko is for you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSukakko is a strategy game, played on a chess-like board. It presents a brand new set of rules, unseen before.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach player secretly selects every unit he will use in the battle, along with a commander to lead them. Each commander has a unique power that can be used once, and each unit moves and attacks in its own way. To be victorious, you will need to: take down the ennemy's commander OR destroy all his regular units.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat will be your strategy?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Recruit your army, by choosing between 6 units and 5 commanders, each with a unique power.<br />\r\n- Test your tactics against the CPU.<br />\r\n- Challenge your friends to see who's the best tactician ! Multiplayer: Online with Steam Remote Play or local on same device.<br />\r\n- Vary board size for different experiences.<br />\r\n- High replayability.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather with your friends and family and challenge them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, don't forget to wishlist my other game Quant about Quantum Physics :) : https://store.steampowered.com/app/1529780/Quant",
